(property "Description" " | design | Constant-current TPS2553DBVR (no -1): in a short on the 2 m IMU cable it limits instead of latching and recovers by itself when the fault clears (SLVS841G p.14-15), so no MCP output, harness wire or software is needed. EN tied to IN: on whenever LAB5 is present (R-E5-08).; DBV SOT-23-6 per SLVS841G Table 5-1: 1 IN, 2 GND, 3 EN, 4 FAULT, 5 ILIM, 6 OUT. RILIM is a starting value (R553). FAULT_N goes to TP503 only." (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
