(text "EDL factory button pads and cable orientation not physically located on the exact received Q6A.\nВорота (стенд): Use the factory button first; continuity-identify its two switch nets before fitting parallel\nSW501. Unplug T7 for EDL and confirm 05c6:9008." (at 13.97 186.71 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 684c0dd3-d1af-5f0b-b42f-8db598ebe456))
