(text "E5-05 — OPEN, блокує випуск — STACK §5.1; §5.2; §8.1 (T7)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 298.45 262.89 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 170 0 0 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 4a8bfe43-2626-5caa-aaa9-1823d95d8e7f))
(text "T7 VBUS rail capacity and modified cable SuperSpeed signal integrity untested.\nВорота (стенд): With a real T7 prove J5 load <1.5 A expected operating budget, VCC_5V_PERI <=14 W, 5000M/UAS,\nno USB resets, fio, hot-corner TJ <=105 C for 1.5 A. Re-evaluate rail/switch/cable if failed." (at 298.45 264.99 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 49d10e54-efb8-5e68-901f-937134620f95))
(rectangle (start 297.18 276.86) (end 434.34 287.02) (stroke (width 0.254) (type dash) (color 0 60 150 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid 3eefad1b-4993-5647-980e-cdb8924ef9c0))
(text "N-E5-03 — примітка — STACK §5.1; §8.1 (T7)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 298.45 278.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 0 60 150 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 3f765601-96df-5bbb-8b94-0075217d2756))
(text "R514 = RILIM TBD (старт 15.8k 1%, 1.51–1.73 A). STACK не задає RILIM для ключа T7 (U505 TPS2553DRVR без\nзасувки — проєктне рішення R-E5-03/R-E5-04). Ворота: E5-04, E5-05." (at 298.45 280.23 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 0c7843c2-b4a6-556e-81da-0ee450d52dd1))
