(text "ADT-Link R44SF connector variant and removal of ALL host 3.3 V paths are not yet confirmed.\nВорота (стенд): Confirm the part with ADT-Link; continuity-test every 3.3 V contact after modification.\nValidate 8 GT/s x1, cold/warm boots and zero AER. Validate a genuine power-cycle with LIME3V3 off, including\nsignal backfeed." (at 407.67 38.93 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 7bc36798-8d3d-5a7b-982e-d118b154980e))
